{"channelId":"UCg4821w_bE7NQCSIOnVG8Tg","row":["Rob Robertson",40,"Rob Robertson is a Registered Massage Therapist (RMQ #M-2915) and owner of The Paw Spa Ottawa-Gatineau K9 Solutions, serving clients in Ontario and Quebec, Canada. He provides massage and teaches canine (K9/dog) and human massage internationally via Udemy, reaching 500+ students in 40+ countries, including the US, Canada, UK, and Australia. Rob completed 2,678 hours of advanced training, including Deep Tissue, Ashiatsu, Pranic Healing, IFC/TENS, and K9 Massage, and was formerly registered with CMTO (2007–2020). He carries full professional liability insurance, is a Blue Cross provider, and offers retail wellness products. Rob delivers customized treatments integrating Myofascial Release, Trigger Point Therapy, Deep Tissue, Ashiatsu, Chakra/Energy Work, and rehabilitative exercises to reduce pain, stress, anxiety, fatigue, migraines, and repetitive strain injuries while improving mobility, flexibility, function, and overall wellness. Contact Rob @itsHealing","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg4821w_bE7NQCSIOnVG8Tg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg4821w_bE7NQCSIOnVG8Tg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:07.305Z","channelId":"UCg4821w_bE7NQCSIOnVG8Tg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"483063d246d9e3b11be9d1d8a69a271ba84d4169a5b252c9e654a79a340b1a2a","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"d274397aef1d8ac4c18a94abc1cd8ef725ea9d34f12a197cced58a54bd21db36"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg4821w_bE7NQCSIOnVG8Tg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":40,"raw":"40 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg4821w_bE7NQCSIOnVG8Tg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:07.305Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["massage therapist"],"relevantKeywords":["massage therapist"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massa